{"title": "Yeenoghu's Hunger (Condition)", "pageid": 28058, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Yeenoghu's_Hunger_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yeenoghu's Hunger Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Yeenoghu%27s_Hunger_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Yeenoghu's Hunger</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Bloated with the spoils of slaughter, but still hungry - a gnoll is growing in the hyena's belly. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">PLA_YEENOGHU_HUNGER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:PLA_YEENOGHU_HUNGER+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:PLA_YEENOGHU_HUNGER+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects Bloated Hyenas with a duration of 2 turns. When it expires, they erupt into a pile of viscera and a <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\">Newborn Gnoll</a> emerges from their corpse.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Creatures_with_Yeenoghu.27s_Hunger\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Yeenoghu's_Hunger\">Creatures with Yeenoghu's Hunger</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloated_Hyena\" title=\"Bloated Hyena\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Hyena.png/30px-Portrait_Hyena.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Hyena.png/45px-Portrait_Hyena.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Hyena.png/60px-Portrait_Hyena.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloated Hyena\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Portrait_Hyena.png/30px-Portrait_Hyena.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Portrait_Hyena.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloated_Hyena\" title=\"Bloated Hyena\">Bloated Hyena</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<di